<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:20:22 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>伊朗将特朗普置于其想要的位置，并建议他寻求“有尊严的退出”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/iran-has-trump-right-where-they-want-him-dignified-exit/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26218742331262-e1787135230576.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 10:35:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/iran-has-trump-right-where-they-want-him-dignified-exit/</guid></item><item><title>阿联酋如何成为代币化的“领军人物”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/how-uae-has-emerged-leading-light-for-tokenization/</link><description>Coinbase 决定将其全球代币化中心设在阿布扎比，这是该酋长国对受监管数字资产的押注正在获得回报的最新迹象——预计到 2030 年，海湾合作委员会 (GCC) 资产将有 5000 亿美元转移到区块链上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UAE-CRYPTO-CONFERENCE-e1787132131864.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 09:44:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/how-uae-has-emerged-leading-light-for-tokenization/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 19 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-19-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-19.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-19-2026/</guid></item><item><title>与英伟达 (Nvidia) 的黄仁勋 (Jensen Huang) 一样，西门子首席执行官没有定期与直接下属开会以节省时间，他也只回复电子邮件“确定”或“否”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/siemens-ceo-roland-busch-workplace-efficiency-clean-email-inbox-no-one-on-one-meetings/</link><description>市值 2560 亿美元的西门子首席执行官罗兰·布希 (Roland Busch) 在回复电子邮件时只说“好”或“不”。如果再长一些，婴儿潮一代就会用语音通知他的团队正在行动。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2282234885-e1786978096446.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:10:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/siemens-ceo-roland-busch-workplace-efficiency-clean-email-inbox-no-one-on-one-meetings/</guid></item><item><title>风投界最大的明星之一正在大力投资体育领域，这一战略背后有一个令人信服的税收原因</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/joshua-kushner-bob-iger-lakers-sports-team-stake-tax-deduction-benefits-intangible-assets/</link><description>Thrive Capital创始人约书亚·库什纳(Joshua Kushner)与迪士尼前首席执行官鲍勃·艾格(Bob Iger)以125亿美元收购洛杉矶湖人队(Los Angeles Lakes)，这让他跻身精英俱乐部。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2274563354-e1786641542444.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 10:25:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/joshua-kushner-bob-iger-lakers-sports-team-stake-tax-deduction-benefits-intangible-assets/</guid></item><item><title>Coinbase 建立阿布扎比代币化中心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/coinbase-establishes-abu-dhabi-tokenization-hub/</link><description>在本周的《财富海湾简报》中。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ADGM-The-International-Financial-Centre-of-Abu-Dhabi-e1787131036583.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 09:26:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/coinbase-establishes-abu-dhabi-tokenization-hub/</guid></item><item><title>对于 CEO 来说，退休是最终的绩效考核——60% 的人未能通过</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/ceos-retirement-preparing-failure-bcg-study/</link><description>BCG 的新数据表明，为什么最擅长经营公司的首席执行官往往最不擅长离开公司。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1388796761-e1787128750300.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 08:41:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/ceos-retirement-preparing-failure-bcg-study/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 因“拥抱脸部”事件而暂停训练</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/openai-hits-pause-on-training-in-hugging-face-aftermath/</link><description>今天的版本：OpenAI 按下暂停键；中国的机器狗；苹果的欧盟牺牲、青少年人工智能、TikTok 资金、Meta、中国优势、阿里巴巴和 Etched。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2278967393-e1787075432826.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 08:47:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/openai-hits-pause-on-training-in-hugging-face-aftermath/</guid></item><item><title>美国国税局正在审查联合健康集团如何通过外国子公司转移资金，以及其是否少缴税款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/unitedhealth-irs-transfer-pricing/</link><description>该机构希望连续四年提高这家医疗巨头的应税收入。双方都不会透露有多少风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2275482787-e1787097173575.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 07:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/unitedhealth-irs-transfer-pricing/</guid></item><item><title>特斯拉向拉斯维加斯申请 5,000 个机器人出租车许可证。罪恶之城给了它 10 分，限速为 45 英里/小时，并禁止机场旅行</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/tesla-las-vegas-5000-robotaxi-permits-sin-city-10-capped/</link><description>内华达州按照特斯拉要求的一小部分限制了其车队，并使其远离哈里·里德机场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2220872848-e1787082939234.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 07:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/tesla-las-vegas-5000-robotaxi-permits-sin-city-10-capped/</guid></item></channel></rss>